      {
        "id": 62572,
        "name": "Belteshazzar",
        "username": "Belteshazzar",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/e274bd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-14T15:29:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"celette482\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/a5b964/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> celette482:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It was rather sneaky. And while we are probably going to have a traditional wedding, I'm hoping we can slip in some references to our geek selves.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No joke, my wife and I named one of our kids Lucas Aaron after Luke Skywalker and Aaron Rodgers. At child dedication at church, we put down on the card that he was named after two close family friends.</p>\n<p>Ooo! In the vows, right after \"in sickness and in health\" (or wherever you please), stick in: \"In peril and in peace.\"</p>\n<p>I bet we could come up with some fantastically nerdy vows. \"In the face of Certain Doom, I'll&nbsp;lead from the front.\"</p>",
